      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794547500380,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "- Backend engineer at Brightloom, 5 years\n- Brightloom got bought last spring: reorgs,\n  \"alignment meetings\", layoff rumors\n- I still like my team but I don't like\n  the work much anymore\n- Some of this might be me wanting OUT,\n  not wanting Tuneslot\n- About $28k saved; my share is maybe\n  $2,900/month, so like 9 months\n- Jess (nurse), we split 50/50; I don't want\n  to dump it on her. Kids in a couple years",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Backend engineer at Brightloom, 5 years\n- Brightloom got bought last spring: reorgs,\n  \"alignment meetings\", layoff rumors\n- I still like my team but I don't like\n  the work much anymore\n- Some of this might be me wanting OUT,\n  not wanting Tuneslot\n- About $28k saved; my share is maybe\n  $2,900/month, so like 9 months\n- Jess (nurse), we split 50/50; I don't want\n  to dump it on her. Kids in a couple years",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "id-bg-2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 409.979736328125,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c23Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1501543608,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 91933112,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794547500380,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "- Tuneslot: booking + lesson reminders for\n  independent music teachers, $12/month\n- 3 paying users: my mom, me (testing\n  billing), one stranger (guitar teacher)\n- The app mostly works\n- Built features for 8 months, basically\n  zero selling; posted in one forum once\n- The guitar guy found that forum post,\n  stayed bc no-shows dropped a lot with\n  the text reminders; paying 5 months\n- If I could work on it full time it'd take\n  off (but I feel insane typing that)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Tuneslot: booking + lesson reminders for\n  independent music teachers, $12/month\n- 3 paying users: my mom, me (testing\n  billing), one stranger (guitar teacher)\n- The app mostly works\n- Built features for 8 months, basically\n  zero selling; posted in one forum once\n- The guitar guy found that forum post,\n  stayed bc no-shows dropped a lot with\n  the text reminders; paying 5 months\n- If I could work on it full time it'd take\n  off (but I feel insane typing that)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
