      "seed": 1557620152,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1340658360,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794547500380,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "Two years from now, I want to...\n- \"run my own thing\"?\n- just \"not dread Mondays\"?\n  (I honestly don't know which)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Two years from now, I want to...\n- \"run my own thing\"?\n- just \"not dread Mondays\"?\n  (I honestly don't know which)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "zkP0INJ7CCSjyys-YsA55",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 562,
      "width": 410.7197265625,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c23T",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 296598456,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 2095940792,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794547509477,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "answer"
      },
      "text": "Hi Owen, I am Claude. Write with the text\ntool (T), then press Send (the paper\nplane at the right). I answer here, in blue.\n\nPurpose, step 2 of 8. Not knowing is fine.\nTry this: picture a good Monday, 2 years\nfrom now. Where are you, what are you\ndoing, who with?\nThen: would you still want Tuneslot if\nwork at a new job felt good again?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Hi Owen, I am Claude. Write with the text\ntool (T), then press Send (the paper\nplane at the right). I answer here, in blue.\n\nPurpose, step 2 of 8. Not knowing is fine.\nTry this: picture a good Monday, 2 years\nfrom now. Where are you, what are you\ndoing, who with?\nThen: would you still want Tuneslot if\nwork at a new job felt good again?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QvU3XgzgJPX2XSbyVkhlS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6.476190567016587,
      "y": 744.5714285714287,
      "width": 538.5796508789062,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c23U",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 216155689,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 2104262439,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794547557668,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Good Monday, 2 yrs out: I wake up and don't dread it.\nI'm building something real people use.\nHome with Jess, maybe planning for a kid.\nWould I still want Tuneslot if a new job felt good?\n...honestly yes, but maybe as a side thing??\nThat kind of scares me. Does that mean\nI don't really want to run my own thing?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Good Monday, 2 yrs out: I wake up and don't dread it.\nI'm building something real people use.\nHome with Jess, maybe planning for a kid.\nWould I still want Tuneslot if a new job felt good?\n...honestly yes, but maybe as a side thing??\nThat kind of scares me. Does that mean\nI don't really want to run my own thing?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "R37uNW5PYhzOr3K8QSU_o",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 830,
      "width": 416.21978759765625,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c23W",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2059471463,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 1023169577,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794547596190,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "answer"
      },
      "text": "Your words sit under Purpose already.\nIt doesn't have to mean that. It may only\nmean \"full time, now\" isn't the point.\nLook at your Monday: no dread, building\nsomething real people use, Jess, a kid.\nNone of that says \"quit\" or \"stay\".\nHere are your words as one Purpose:\n\"Build something real people use,\nwithout dreading Mondays, on ground\nsteady enough for Jess and a kid.\"\nDoes that fit? Change any word.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Your words sit under Purpose already.\nIt doesn't have to mean that. It may only\nmean \"full time, now\" isn't the point.\nLook at your Monday: no dread, building\nsomething real people use, Jess, a kid.\nNone of that says \"quit\" or \"stay\".\nHere are your words as one Purpose:\n\"Build something real people use,\nwithout dreading Mondays, on ground\nsteady enough for Jess and a kid.\"\nDoes that fit? Change any word.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ilz0PrxDwK_PjSgzQKfG5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 563.8241795131139,
      "y": 1150.357142857143,
      "width": 496.3196716308594,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c23X",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1083303689,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 2014254151,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794547622229,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Yeah... that fits. weirdly calming to read.\nOne change: add \"and not spend my 40s\nwondering 'what if' about Tuneslot.\"\nThat part is real too, not just the money.\n\nBut now I have 2 big things pulling different ways.\nIs there a way of thinking people use for this\nkind of decision? like an actual method?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Yeah... that fits. weirdly calming to read.\nOne change: add \"and not spend my 40s\nwondering 'what if' about Tuneslot.\"\nThat part is real too, not just the money.\n\nBut now I have 2 big things pulling different ways.\nIs there a way of thinking people use for this\nkind of decision? like an actual method?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
