      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "answer"
      },
      "text": "Added your line. Purpose is set (left).\nYes, a real method: we're in step 3 of 8,\nAnalysis. For two pulls, two classics:\n- Force-Field Analysis: list the forces\n  pushing you toward Tuneslot and the\n  forces holding you back, weigh each.\n- Pros and Cons: per option, the good\n  and bad, side by side.\nForce-Field fits \"pulling different\nways\" best. Want to see an example?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Added your line. Purpose is set (left).\nYes, a real method: we're in step 3 of 8,\nAnalysis. For two pulls, two classics:\n- Force-Field Analysis: list the forces\n  pushing you toward Tuneslot and the\n  forces holding you back, weigh each.\n- Pros and Cons: per option, the good\n  and bad, side by side.\nForce-Field fits \"pulling different\nways\" best. Want to see an example?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "FdGt2DJGYIKX26K92iGRk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600.2241734095983,
      "y": 1687.857142857143,
      "width": 463.7397155761719,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
