      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "Notes\n- [ 4 ] hate the reorgs: it's a job\n  problem; reorgs push me toward ANY way\n  out; a nicer job would fix that one\n- \"1 customer\" is a 5 bc it's the one\n  that makes me feel dumb",
