      "text": "Moved reorgs to Notes. Toward is now 7.\nI wrote your findings under # Analysis.\nThat's a big shift: 1 customer is not a\nverdict yet. It's an untested question.\nNext is step 4 of 8, the Issue: the ONE\nquestion that, once answered, settles\n\"quit or stay\" for you.\nIn your words, what is that question?",
