      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "Draft: \"If real teachers actually hear\nabout Tuneslot, will enough of them pay?\"\n- \"enough\" = like replace my salary\n  (a LOT of $12 teachers)\n- I can find that out without quitting",
