      "index": "c23v",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1172849513,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 518079975,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794547960619,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ok. gut number: 25 paying teachers who\naren't my mom, by end of April.\n(about 5 months of nights + weekends)\n25 x $12 = $300/mo, tiny, but it would prove\npeople pay once they hear about it.\nWait, if I hit 25, does that mean quit?\nor do I just keep moving the bar?\nbc I know me, I'd move the bar.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ok. gut number: 25 paying teachers who\naren't my mom, by end of April.\n(about 5 months of nights + weekends)\n25 x $12 = $300/mo, tiny, but it would prove\npeople pay once they hear about it.\nWait, if I hit 25, does that mean quit?\nor do I just keep moving the bar?\nbc I know me, I'd move the bar.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
