      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794547982870,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "answer"
      },
      "text": "Sharpened Issue is under # Issue.\nNow it's a question you can answer by\na date. Good.\n\"I'd move the bar\": great catch. The fix\nis to set the rule now, before April,\nwhile you're calm. Two blanks:\n- If I hit 25 by April, I will ...\n- If I don't, I will ...\nWhat goes in each? Your words.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Sharpened Issue is under # Issue.\nNow it's a question you can answer by\na date. Good.\n\"I'd move the bar\": great catch. The fix\nis to set the rule now, before April,\nwhile you're calm. Two blanks:\n- If I hit 25 by April, I will ...\n- If I don't, I will ...\nWhat goes in each? Your words.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9ypBWBGLOI5DvKaw5T0ZF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1501.9965311686196,
      "y": 3133.166666666667,
      "width": 482.55975341796875,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c23y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1267891847,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 153570089,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794548018138,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- If I hit 25 by April, I will sit down with\n  Jess and set a real quit date, with a money\n  number we both agree on. not just me deciding.\n- If I don't, I will stop asking \"what if\",\n  keep Tuneslot as a hobby for mom + guitar guy,\n  and look for a job that isn't Brightloom.\nWriting that 2nd one stung a bit. but I can\nlive with it. and Jess has to see this first.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- If I hit 25 by April, I will sit down with\n  Jess and set a real quit date, with a money\n  number we both agree on. not just me deciding.\n- If I don't, I will stop asking \"what if\",\n  keep Tuneslot as a hobby for mom + guitar guy,\n  and look for a job that isn't Brightloom.\nWriting that 2nd one stung a bit. but I can\nlive with it. and Jess has to see this first.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
