      "originalText": "Rule, set now (Jess has to see this first):\n- If I hit 25 by April, I will sit down with\n  Jess and set a real quit date, with a money\n  number we both agree on\n- If I don't, I will stop asking \"what if\",\n  keep Tuneslot as a hobby for mom + guitar\n  guy, and look for a job that isn't Brightloom",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
