      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "answer"
      },
      "text": "Your rule is under # Issue. That 2nd\nline took guts. Both paths fit your\nPurpose; neither one is failing.\nAnd yes: Jess first. Good call.\nStep 5 of 8, Challenge: to reach 25 by\nApril, what do you have to overcome?\nThink of the big blocks, 2 to 4 of them.\n(e.g. from another life: \"get seen by\nmy buyers\", \"find time weekly\")",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Your rule is under # Issue. That 2nd\nline took guts. Both paths fit your\nPurpose; neither one is failing.\nAnd yes: Jess first. Good call.\nStep 5 of 8, Challenge: to reach 25 by\nApril, what do you have to overcome?\nThink of the big blocks, 2 to 4 of them.\n(e.g. from another life: \"get seen by\nmy buyers\", \"find time weekly\")",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
