      "versionNonce": 1707059689,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794548078008,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Big blocks:\n1. getting in front of teachers at all.\n   I don't know where they hang out besides\n   that one forum.\n2. me. I hide in coding. selling = scary.\n   I'll \"just fix one more feature\" forever.\n3. time/energy. post-reorg I'm wiped by 7pm.\n4. Jess. she doesn't know how serious I am yet.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Big blocks:\n1. getting in front of teachers at all.\n   I don't know where they hang out besides\n   that one forum.\n2. me. I hide in coding. selling = scary.\n   I'll \"just fix one more feature\" forever.\n3. time/energy. post-reorg I'm wiped by 7pm.\n4. Jess. she doesn't know how serious I am yet.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "id-ch-1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2200,
      "width": 432.4197082519531,
      "height": 600,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c243",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1709992905,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 67771113,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794548232490,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "claudeItem"
      },
      "text": "1. Get in front of teachers at all\n   (I only know that one forum)\n     - Ask mom about her local teachers\n       group (40ish people)\n     - Ask guitar guy where he hangs out\n       online\n     - Demo it at mom's group meeting (Jan?)\n     - Give a free first month; ask each\n       teacher for 1 intro\n     - Post in 3 more teacher groups,\n       not just 1\n     - Send 10 personal msgs/week to\n       local teachers\n2. Sell instead of hiding in coding\n   (\"just fix one more feature\" forever)\n     - Freeze features till April;\n       bug fixes only (oof)\n3. Find time and energy\n   (post-reorg I'm wiped by 7pm)\n     - Do outreach Sat mornings + 2 lunch\n       breaks/week, not 9pm as a zombie\n4. Bring Jess in\n   (she doesn't know how serious I am yet)\n     - Show her this board on Sunday",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Get in front of teachers at all\n   (I only know that one forum)\n     - Ask mom about her local teachers\n       group (40ish people)\n     - Ask guitar guy where he hangs out\n       online\n     - Demo it at mom's group meeting (Jan?)\n     - Give a free first month; ask each\n       teacher for 1 intro\n     - Post in 3 more teacher groups,\n       not just 1\n     - Send 10 personal msgs/week to\n       local teachers\n2. Sell instead of hiding in coding\n   (\"just fix one more feature\" forever)\n     - Freeze features till April;\n       bug fixes only (oof)\n3. Find time and energy\n   (post-reorg I'm wiped by 7pm)\n     - Do outreach Sat mornings + 2 lunch\n       breaks/week, not 9pm as a zombie\n4. Bring Jess in\n   (she doesn't know how serious I am yet)\n     - Show her this board on Sunday",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
