      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "answer"
      },
      "text": "Your 4 blocks are under # Challenge.\nI polished them into \"do\" phrases, e.g.\n\"me. I hide in coding\" became \"Sell\ninstead of hiding in coding\". Your words\nstay in brackets. Tell me if one is off.\nHonest list. #2 may be the key one: it\nwas why 60 views stayed 60.\nStep 6 of 8, Measure: for each block,\none or two ways to beat it. Start with\nwhichever feels easiest.",
