      "text": "Easiest first, Jess: show her this board on\nSunday. like literally this page.\nTeachers: ask mom, she's in a local teachers\ngroup w/ 40ish people. ask guitar guy where\nhe hangs out online. \nHiding in code: feature freeze till April.\nbug fixes only. (oof)\nEnergy: Sat mornings + 2 lunch breaks/week\nfor outreach, not 9pm when I'm a zombie.",
