      "customData": {
        "grwbKind": "answer"
      },
      "text": "Your measures sit under each block.\nSolid set. Freeze = brave.\nOne question (the gray ? at block 1):\n60 views gave 1 paying teacher. If that\nheld, 25 means roughly 1,500 teachers\nhearing of it. Mom's 40 + the guitar\nguy's spots: is that enough reach?\nOr does block 1 need one more way in?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Your measures sit under each block.\nSolid set. Freeze = brave.\nOne question (the gray ? at block 1):\n60 views gave 1 paying teacher. If that\nheld, 25 means roughly 1,500 teachers\nhearing of it. Mom's 40 + the guitar\nguy's spots: is that enough reach?\nOr does block 1 need one more way in?",
