      "updated": 1794548208192,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1,500 hurts to read lol. but a bit unfair?\na forum post is cold. mom vouching for me\nin person to 40 teachers is not the same.\nstill, fair, not enough. add:\n- demo it at mom's group meeting (Jan?)\n- free first month, ask each teacher for 1 intro\n- post in 3 more teacher groups, not just 1\n- 10 personal msgs/week to local teachers\nThat's scary but doable.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1,500 hurts to read lol. but a bit unfair?\na forum post is cold. mom vouching for me\nin person to 40 teachers is not the same.\nstill, fair, not enough. add:\n- demo it at mom's group meeting (Jan?)\n- free first month, ask each teacher for 1 intro\n- post in 3 more teacher groups, not just 1\n- 10 personal msgs/week to local teachers\nThat's scary but doable.",
