      "text": "Your tasks are under # Task. Real days,\nreal hours. It IS real now.\nLast step, 8 of 8: the Answer.\nBack to your first question: \"should\nI quit my job?\" Looking at everything\non the board, what's your answer today?\nOne or two lines, your words.\nI'll write it under # Answer.",
