      "text": "Not yet. I keep the job and go find out\nfor real: 25 paying teachers by end of April.\nThen Jess and I decide together, with numbers.\n(and if Brightloom lays me off before then,\nI guess the universe decides early lol)\nThanks. I came in wanting a yes or no and I\nthink this is better. I'm good for now.",
